@startuml US106a-DM
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Airport Aggregate" {
    class Airport <<Entity>> <<Root>> {
        - iataCode        : IATACode
        - certifiedModels : Set<ModelDesignation>
        + addCertification(modelDesignation : ModelDesignation) : void
    }
    class IATACode <<Value Object>> {
        - code : String
    }
    Airport *-- IATACode
    Airport *-- "0..*" ModelDesignation
}

package "Aircraft Aggregate" {
    class Aircraft <<Entity>> <<Root>> {
        - model : AircraftModel
    }
    class AircraftModel <<Entity>> {
        - designation : ModelDesignation
    }
    class ModelDesignation <<Value Object>> {
        - manufacturer : String
        - modelName    : String
    }
    Aircraft      *-- AircraftModel
    AircraftModel *-- ModelDesignation
}

Airport ..> AircraftModel : certified for >\n(by ModelDesignation identity only — cross-aggregate reference)

note as N1
  <b>Cross-aggregate reference rule (DDD):</b>
  Airport stores <i>ModelDesignation</i> (identity value object),
  not a direct reference to the AircraftModel entity.
  Existence of the AircraftModel is verified by the
  AddAirportCertificationUseCase before modifying the aggregate.
end note

@enduml
